{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 18, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "Verily, a grand journey to Japan doth thou seek, and a Shakespearean style of itinerary I shall pen forthwith, sans any commas.\n\nFirstly, to Tokyo thou shalt wend thy way, and there, in the city's heart, Shinjuku's bustling market thou shalt visit, where the vibrant life and diverse flavors shall greet thy senses.\n\nNext, to Kyoto, the city of a thousand temples, thou shalt proceed, and there, in the serene gardens of Kinkaku-ji, thy soul shall find solace, as the golden pavilion doth reflect upon the tranquil pond.\n\nDoth thou then journey to Nara, where deer roam free and the Todai-ji's grandeur shall inspire awe in thy heart, as the Buddha's statue, so vast and grand, doth loom within.\n\nAfterward, to Hiroshima thou shalt go, and there, at the Peace Memorial Park, thou shalt remember the solemn history and the enduring hope for peace, as the A-bomb Dome doth stand as a poignant testament.\n\nLastly, to Osaka, the city of culinary delights, thou shalt conclude thy sojourn, where the vibrant Dotonbori district's lights and flavors shall dance within thy memory, and the laughter of the people shall echo in thy ears.\n\nThus, thy journey through Japan, a tapestry of old and new, of history and culture, of beauty and flavor, shalt be complete, and the memories of this grand adventure shall forever be etched within thy heart.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Ver", "logprob": -3.7712647914886475}, {"token": "ily", "logprob": -0.0021128966473042965}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.010357674211263657}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -1.6195220947265625}, {"token": " grand", "logprob": -2.896575450897217}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -1.2493294477462769}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.5776423215866089}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -1.5219825506210327}, {"token": " d", "logprob": -1.1366137266159058}, {"token": "oth", "logprob": -0.07914222031831741